<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - ARGENTINA'S LEDESMA Q1 NET $7.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ARGENTINA'S LEDESMA Q1 NET $7.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30. Net $7.2 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company provided no comparative, EPS or ADR. Ledesma SAAI said results include an extraordinary gain of $4.04 million and are after $3.15 million payments in income tax. It reported a net worth of $490.4 million and retained earnings of $28.16 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
